{"availability":"available","full":"Lilli-Ai/my-ai-journey","name":"my-ai-journey","description":"Personal knowledge base documenting my AI Automation / Agentic AI journey — from coursework to production projects (Travel Tech focus)","category":"Design","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-03T21:32:31Z","updated":"2026-10-03T10:01:02Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lilia-ai.replit.app","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-automation","gradio","knowledge-base","low-code","make-com","n8n","no-code","portfolio","travel-tech"],"demo":"https://lilia-ai.replit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.084Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.084Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.084Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.084Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Personal knowledge base documenting my path into AI Automation and Agentic AI, built by Lilia Avagyan.","I started my career in customer-facing operations in IT and telecommunications. Working in these environments, I saw firsthand how much time went into repetitive tasks and manual processes. Eventually, I decided to learn how to automate them myself.","Since then, I've built 20+ applications using no-code, low-code, and traditional development tools, including AI travel guides, Telegram bots, and resume analyzers. I completed my Agentic AI course with distinction, presenting three final projects: a job board automation system, a full-stack portfolio platform, and a TravelTech insights dashboard with an AI chatbot. After completing the course, I was personally invited to continue to the advanced program."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Lilli-Ai/my-ai-journey/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7ff43e5cd3ae20220d7a3e8626dba3b07a0a03948cf80038aa3d9d66f119405e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.204Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.204Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"what